stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Uploaded: User uploads PDF/DOCX
    Uploaded --> Queued: DB Transaction Committed & Task Dispatched
    Queued --> Processing: Celery Worker picks up job
    Processing --> Extracting: PyMuPDF / python-docx parses pages
    Extracting --> Chunking: Recursive chunker with overlap
    Chunking --> Embedding: FastEmbed computes vectors
    Embedding --> Storing: Atomic DB batch insert to pgvector
    Storing --> Completed: Document marked completed
    Processing --> Failed: Corrupt file or extraction exception
    Failed --> Queued: User triggers /retry endpoint
    Completed --> [*]
